// # AI Algo Submodule Hub -- Zero-Drag
//
// Logline: Re-exports pure CS algorithms: probabilistic data structures (HyperLogLog, Bloom, Cuckoo, Count-Min, Quotient, MinHash, TopK, t-digest, Misra-Gries), complex network generators (Erdos-Renyi, Watts-Strogatz, Barabasi-Albert, Stochastic Block, HRG), and graph theory (centrality, community, layout, similarity, connectivity). Split from the prior std/ai/graph_networks/ tree in Phase 3.5: pure CS algorithms live here, network routing protocols moved to std/net/protocol/routing/.
//
// Setup: Domain module under std/app/ai/algo. Pure compute, no caps.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Probabilistic data structures: hyperloglog_*, bloom_filter_*, cuckoo_filter_*, count_min_*, quotient_filter_*, minhash_*, topk_*, tdigest_*, misra_gries_*, flajolet_martin_*, hyperanf_*.
//   2. Complex network generators: erdos_renyi_*, watts_strogatz_*, barabasi_albert_*, stochastic_block_*, hierarchical_random_*.
//   3. Graph theory: brandes_*, closeness_*, eigenvector_*, girvan_newman_*, label_propagation_*, core_periphery_*, triadic_*, modularity_*, simrank_*, fruchterman_*, kamada_*, tarjan_*, graph_degree_*.
//   4. Cross-cutting facade: graph_networks (re-exports all CS algorithms + all net/protocol/routing/* files for backward-compat consumers).
//   5. Stubs: graph_networks_stubs (fail-closed guards for native FFI).

